#: lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker.php
msgid "https://sdv.design"
msgstr "https://sdv.design"

#. Description of the plugin
#: lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker.php
msgid "Lightweight, high-performance tracking for Meta Pixel & Conversions API, Google Ads (Consent Mode v2) and TikTok Pixel – with URL-based multi-platform events and clean event deduplication."
msgstr "Schlankes, performantes Tracking für Meta Pixel & Conversions API, Google Ads (Consent Mode v2) und TikTok Pixel – mit URL-basierten Multi-Plattform-Events und sauberer Event-Deduplizierung."

#. Author of the plugin
#: lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker.php
msgid "Dominik Seitz"
msgstr "Dominik Seitz"

